      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL itself looks fine to me.\nBut I\u0027m wondering what the impact is if we allow multiple functions settable.\nSome Apps (e.g. Settings UI) rely on those function flags.\nWe may need the corresponding owner to review if there is any impact to them in advance.\nOr at least they should be notified so as to be aware of this change if they meet any regression issue after this CL merged.\nAlso we may need to review through USB Framework to evaluate all the dependent code that refers to those flags.",
