      "writtenOn": "2021-01-26T05:12:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As far as I can tell, the only user of FUNCTION_NCM in the tree is tethering, which is code our team maintains. We\u0027re aware of the implications to that code.\n\nAre you concerned that if the something enables FUNCTION_NCM and FUNCTION_RNDIS at the same time, there may be some code that receives the USB broadcast and behaves incorrectly? For example, code that does:\n\n    if (functions \u003d\u003d FUNCTION_RNDIS) {\n        ...\n\ninstead of doing:\n\n    if ((functions \u0026 FUNCTION_RNDIS) !\u003d 0) {\n        ...\n\n?",
      "parentUuid": "6f967107_55e7645c",
      "revId": "79c9c9e365e30dc08452f7dd245559a431e06d0a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
